      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "One additional point.\n\nIt is not easy to go back to Home in the current Guided Mode, and it is undesirable to have to go through an unrelated world/instance traveling to go back to Home (there is a button to go Home while instance traveling) or to disable the Guided Mode.\n\nIt would be nice to have a button somewhere to Go Home without having to disable Guided Mode.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "644d782ced4d5408fdfc0cfd",
      "author": {
        "_id": "619ffdfe00e2a864e7efb2e1",
        "alias": "Cooing Porpoise",
