      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The menu isn't supposed to be informative, it isn't for advanced users.\n\nThe current Guide menu (in my opinion) is great for me letting a friend on my account when they come over. For someone who has no clue what VR is, or for someone who has never played VRChat before, the current guide menu is perfect. It's also perfect for people that have disabilities.\n\nThe only thing I think they should change would be to teach portal placement:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/1301-suggestion-add-a-drop-portal-button-on-guided-menu-worlds\n\nAnd rather then being a big green button at the top of the menu, it should be a setting you enable in accessibility options.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
