      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{619ffdfe00e2a864e7efb2e1|full_name}: Now, actually invite your friends (non-native English speakers as much as possible) to play that menu and show them around.\n\nOr, let only your friend play.\n\nIf it leads them to use the main menu more or to change to the regular quick menu first, then I think the menu is a failure.\n\nIt should be a clue to finding a community where you can get an explanation before you are on your own, not a tutorial that you only use for the first moments.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
