      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I definitely agree this mode needs more work. The biggest issue I have come across is that several of the buttons in the UI just whisk you away to a new instance without so much as an \"Are you sure?\". In my opinion it is a massive UX failure to have any button that throws you into a loading screen (that might I note has no \"back\" or \"cancel\" button!) without it being absolutely 100% obvious and clear that it is going to do that.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
