      "value": "@{5f30ecee654cd4491456a82f|full_name}: If there is more than one player in guide mode, I don't think it is a good UX to have no guidance to move to the main menu and place drop portals.\n\nEven if you find a friendly player, there is a good chance you will touch the world move by mistake and end up in a once in a lifetime situation.",
