  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The current guide menu is too unfriendly. It does not explain much about what happens when you USE a button, etc., to native English speakers as it does to non-English speakers. It only creates confusion for beginners.\n\nAt the very least.\n\nA confirmation popup should appear when the button to move worlds is pressed.\n\nWhen you USE a word in a search, instead of moving to a random world on the fly, show a list of worlds to give you multiple options to choose from.\n\nCreate an option for each language in Easy Word Search for specific language speakers.\n\nThis is the only thing that is absolutely necessary.",
